<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="578524980"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:52.853"><div begin="13.585" end="36.989" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.585" end="18.564" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.585" end="14.018">我和</span><span begin="14.018" end="14.359">你</span><span begin="14.359" end="14.809">啊</span> <span begin="15.171" end="15.651">存在</span><span begin="15.651" end="16.033">一</span><span begin="16.033" end="16.349">种</span><span begin="16.349" end="17.554">危险关</span><span begin="17.554" end="18.564">系</span></p><p begin="20.012" end="25.015" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.012" end="20.366">彼此</span><span begin="20.366" end="20.849">挟</span><span begin="20.849" end="21.414">持</span> <span begin="21.636" end="22.126">这另</span><span begin="22.126" end="22.806">一部</span><span begin="22.806" end="23.322">分</span><span begin="23.322" end="24.169">的自</span><span begin="24.169" end="25.015">己</span></p><p begin="25.633" end="31.506" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.633" end="25.969">本</span><span begin="25.969" end="26.512">以</span><span begin="26.512" end="26.878">为</span><span begin="26.878" end="27.390">这</span><span begin="27.390" end="28.157">完</span><span begin="28.157" end="28.979">整了</span><span begin="28.979" end="29.746">爱</span><span begin="29.746" end="30.626">的定</span><span begin="30.626" end="31.506">义</span></p><p begin="32.212" end="36.989" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.212" end="32.602">那</span><span begin="32.602" end="34.216">就乖乖地</span><span begin="34.216" end="35.052">守护</span><span begin="35.052" end="35.786">着</span><span begin="35.786" end="36.989">你</span></p></div><div begin="39.415" end="1:04.079" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="39.415" end="44.323" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.415" end="39.899">相爱</span><span begin="39.899" end="40.294">变</span><span begin="40.294" end="40.733">成</span> <span begin="41.003" end="41.435">猜忌</span><span begin="41.435" end="41.868">怀</span><span begin="41.868" end="42.300">疑</span><span begin="42.342" end="42.752">的</span><span begin="42.752" end="43.146">烂</span><span begin="43.146" end="43.460">游</span><span begin="43.460" end="44.323">戏</span></p><p begin="45.937" end="51.156" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.937" end="46.363">规则</span><span begin="46.363" end="46.789">是</span><span begin="46.789" end="47.215">要</span> <span begin="47.543" end="47.966">憋着</span><span begin="47.966" end="48.325">呼</span><span begin="48.325" end="48.716">吸</span><span begin="48.811" end="49.986">越靠越</span><span begin="49.986" end="51.156">近</span></p><p begin="51.639" end="57.763" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.639" end="52.015">但</span><span begin="52.015" end="52.509">你</span><span begin="52.509" end="53.220">的温</span><span begin="53.220" end="54.084">柔</span> <span begin="54.084" end="54.911">是我</span><span begin="54.911" end="55.695">唯</span><span begin="55.695" end="56.140">一</span><span begin="56.140" end="56.824">沉</span><span begin="56.824" end="57.763">溺</span></p><p begin="58.115" end="1:04.079" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.115" end="58.905">你是</span><span begin="58.905" end="59.373">爱</span><span begin="59.373" end="1:00.072">我</span><span begin="1:00.072" end="1:00.566">的</span> <span begin="1:00.870" end="1:01.705">就不</span><span begin="1:01.705" end="1:02.185">怕</span><span begin="1:02.185" end="1:02.919">有缝</span><span begin="1:02.919" end="1:04.079">隙</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.080" end="1:32.027" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:05.080" end="1:10.347" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.080" end="1:05.719">在我</span><span begin="1:05.719" end="1:06.237">心</span><span begin="1:06.237" end="1:06.940">上</span><span begin="1:06.940" end="1:07.807">用力</span><span begin="1:07.807" end="1:08.673">地</span><span begin="1:08.673" end="1:09.425">开一</span><span begin="1:09.425" end="1:10.347">枪</span></p><p begin="1:11.536" end="1:17.192" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.536" end="1:12.654">让一切</span><span begin="1:12.654" end="1:13.417">归</span><span begin="1:13.417" end="1:14.340">零在</span><span begin="1:14.340" end="1:15.066">这</span><span begin="1:15.066" end="1:15.559">声</span><span begin="1:15.559" end="1:16.259">巨</span><span begin="1:16.259" end="1:17.192">响</span></p><p begin="1:17.582" end="1:23.200" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.582" end="1:17.998">如果</span><span begin="1:17.998" end="1:19.165">爱是说</span><span begin="1:19.165" end="1:20.038">什</span><span begin="1:20.038" end="1:20.709">么</span><span begin="1:20.871" end="1:21.637">都</span><span begin="1:21.637" end="1:22.473">不能</span><span begin="1:22.473" end="1:23.200">放</span></p><p begin="1:23.210" end="1:32.027" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.210" end="1:23.633">我</span><span begin="1:23.633" end="1:24.279">不</span><span begin="1:24.279" end="1:24.912">挣</span><span begin="1:24.912" end="1:26.191">扎</span> <span begin="1:26.466" end="1:27.333">反正</span><span begin="1:27.333" end="1:28.004">我</span><span begin="1:28.004" end="1:29.577">也</span><span begin="1:30.222" end="1:30.713">没</span><span begin="1:30.713" end="1:32.027">差</span></p></div><div begin="1:58.962" end="2:23.549" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:58.962" end="2:03.870" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.962" end="1:59.446">相爱</span><span begin="1:59.446" end="1:59.841">变</span><span begin="1:59.841" end="2:00.280">成</span> <span begin="2:00.550" end="2:00.982">猜忌</span><span begin="2:00.982" end="2:01.415">怀</span><span begin="2:01.415" end="2:01.847">疑</span><span begin="2:01.889" end="2:02.299">的</span><span begin="2:02.299" end="2:02.693">烂</span><span begin="2:02.693" end="2:03.007">游</span><span begin="2:03.007" end="2:03.870">戏</span></p><p begin="2:05.361" end="2:10.580" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.361" end="2:05.787">规则</span><span begin="2:05.7